WEBVTT

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.580
Welcome to Valverde.

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:24.940
I'm incredibly grateful that you'd 
welcome a defeated soldier like me.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.040
So this is a relic?

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:36.660
The key to our Fuhrer's glory, 
and the Welthauptstadt Germania project.

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:39.360
The power of the relics

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:42.620
can be called a fourth Energy, 
which will open the path to a new future.

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:32.210
<b>Episode 2
Last Resort</b>

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:43.250
Prepare to withdraw!

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:49.780
And after we've only just met?

00:02:57.140 --> 00:02:58.400
What is that?

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:07.610
We avoided it!

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:17.060
You'll bring the number to 73,794.

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:22.080
Your lives will be the building blocks 
of the world revolution.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:28.760
<i>Seilien coffin Airgetlám tron.</i>

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:26.700
A song?

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:27.680
Where is it coming from?

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:50.030
Ogawa-san stayed behind to deal 
with the chemical weapons plant.

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:52.740
We're tracking the plant's commander.

00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:54.490
Maria and the girls?

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:57.650
They initiated combat 
with a group of alchemists

00:03:57.650 --> 00:03:59.470
while rescuing Fujitaka and Tomosato.

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:02.890
Given the emergency, 
they're using the last of their Model K.

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:04.490
The LiNKER...

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:08.980
But its duration hasn't been 
adjusted to match the user.

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:10.550
It won't last long.

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:12.210
We need to hurry back!

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:14.810
Dummy! We're in the middle of a mission, too.

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:16.480
<i>Believe in our friends!</i>

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:21.050
The LiNKER creation recipe that 
was recorded on Dr. Ver's chip...

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:26.310
Decrypting it is my job, 
but I haven't gotten it yet...

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.780
Wh-What?

00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:31.880
We also have to believe in our friends.

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:35.200
Believe in our friends...

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:38.720
Are you two okay?

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:39.640
Yeah.

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:41.320
You can leave this...

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:42.640
...to us!

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:45.710
So you've come, Symphogears.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:49.470
We finally meet, Bavarian Illuminati!

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:52.350
What are you planning this time?

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:53.980
A revolution!

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:56.560
Restoring history to the hands 
of its rightful owners

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.110
has long been our dream!

00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:06.360
<i>How many times did I cry? 
How many times did I break?</i>

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:11.890
<i>It doesn't matter at all.</i>

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.260
Her attacks aren't working!

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:18.370
<i>There's no need for pride 
or fancy accessories</i>

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:16.160
Oh, my, they're fast!

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:18.370
Let's stop them in their tracks, then.

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:23.040
<i>Let's bare ourselves</i>

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:31.300
<i>My friends who clench their 
fists and grab their swords</i>

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:35.570
<i>and raise their bows</i>

00:05:35.570 --> 00:05:41.030
<i>They go ahead of me and show me the way</i>

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:43.710
This body was given to me by Carol.

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:51.590
<i>Sing to tell the world that your tragedies 
and tears will turn into dreams</i>

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:46.700
I'm always helpless and in the way!

00:05:51.590 --> 00:05:54.240
<i>For the true meaning of strength</i>

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:54.950
Maria!

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:57.070
<i>Accept your weakness and fly, now!</i>

00:05:57.070 --> 00:06:02.470
<i>A thousand wounds are proof you didn't 
run more than a thousand times</i>

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:07.770
<i>On the day you're defeated, 
rise up and accept it all</i>

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:20.750
<i>Yell to the heavens that you are yourself!</i>

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:11.430
Got it!

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:13.900
You really think so, huh?

00:06:17.670 --> 00:06:18.980
It didn't work?

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:22.090
Is it that phase-whatsits 
that the Noise had?

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:26.240
Then it doesn't make sense that 
the Symphogears aren't working!

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:30.980
If it's nullifying the damage, 
I just need to hit harder!

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:37.000
<i>Stay true to yourself, protect who you are</i>

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:47.260
<i>The resolve of my silver arm 
is for the bonds I share!</i>

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:01.630
It's regenerating?

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:03.470
No. It's...

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:05.900
The damage never happened.

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:08.500
The experiment was a success.

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:12.940
A phenomenon beyond the laws of the 
universe, which reverses the irreversible.

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:16.540
At last, alchemy has reached 
the pinnacle of human knowledge.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:18.820
We have realized the power of a god.

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:21.940
If we can't win, we need to run!

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:24.790
Get out of here!

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:25.580
Yes.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:27.840
You're not getting away.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:31.750
Ow!

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:34.170
My face! Oh, jeez!

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:36.650
My village is up ahead!

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:39.020
If the soldiers are going somewhere, 
they'll be going...

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:46.680
The Alca-Noise?

00:07:48.140 --> 00:07:50.130
You know what this is, right?

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:55.670
Try anything and I'll have 
the Alca-Noise dissolve them!

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:57.400
That bastard!

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:05.140
There's your escape route!

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:06.180
You can do it, right?

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:08.520
We'll make it work!

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:09.330
It's crazy!

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:11.850
How high up are we?

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:15.390
It's persistent, like a snake!

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:18.250
Well, it is a big snake!

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:24.850
It's time!

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:25.970
Yes!

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:27.900
Jump!

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:36.020
Maria!

00:08:39.110 --> 00:08:40.210
There it is!

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:49.080
It's not giving up!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:56.470
It disappeared?

00:08:57.790 --> 00:09:02.010
What? We're not allowed to send 
Youaltepuztli after them?

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:05.120
We've confirmed the realization 
of the power of the gods.

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:07.210
That's enough for now.

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:09.980
So there's no reason to pursue them.

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:13.280
Let's hurry and recover Tiki instead.

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:19.110
My demands are simple. Let me go!

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:21.500
Or people who don't have 
to die are gonna die!

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:22.820
Coward!

00:09:23.270 --> 00:09:26.180
You, too! Try anything and...

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:31.220
Stephan!

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:33.750
Let's go!

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.390
Let's do this, Tachibana!

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:37.210
Yes!

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:45.730
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:52.040
Shit!

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:56.120
Those stupid brats...

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:01.880
No!

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:07.280
You run!

00:10:08.990 --> 00:10:09.660
Stephan!

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:16.750
Damn it all!

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:23.980
We've secured the plant's commander.

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:28.050
But one of the civilians was injured.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:31.360
Stephan! Stephan!

00:10:32.010 --> 00:10:33.500
How did this happen?

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:35.470
Sonya...

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:40.140
Chris, you did this to my brother...

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:43.320
You shot his leg!

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:45.660
Yeah.

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:49.460
I'm the one who pulled the trigger.

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:56.740
We've returned from our observation mission.

00:10:56.740 --> 00:10:58.040
Well done.

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:00.890
It's good to be back at HQ...

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:01.830
I feel so relaxed.

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:04.220
But there'll be no sleeping tonight!

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:09.150
Yeah. Getting this data just about killed me.

00:11:09.150 --> 00:11:10.480
I'm gonna get right on!

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:14.160
So they've got a monster that even 
all of us together can't hurt, huh?

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:18.540
We've brought the 
Bavarian Illuminati out of the shadows,

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:20.860
but they won't be easy to take on.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.010
Don't worry.

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:23.060
Yeah!

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:24.910
Next time, for sure...

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:27.920
I'm sorry.

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:30.690
If only we had enough LiNKER,

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:32.950
there'd be plenty of next times, but...

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:36.210
No... I didn't mean it like that...

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:39.390
I don't think I can decode 
the recipe, after all...

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:44.650
Wh-What are you doing?

00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:48.260
We came back a mess, but I 
don't think we've lost yet.

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:53.050
Nobody's at fault, so there's 
no need for you to apologize.

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:56.970
Yes, we haven't given up.

00:11:56.970 --> 00:12:00.570
I'm at the age where I want 
"Do your best!" not "I'm sorry!"

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:03.270
You want that more than "I'm sorry"?

00:12:03.270 --> 00:12:04.010
Yes.

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:21.840
<b>400 Years Ago</b>

00:12:22.490 --> 00:12:24.240
In the distant past,

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:27.820
we brought together the fragments of 
heretical technology that Finé had left,

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:30.910
and created our own alchemy.

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:32.980
We are the Bavarian Illuminati.

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:36.880
That's why it was inevitable that we 
would come into contact with Finé,

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:40.270
who wanted to maintain her power by 
keeping the heretical technology to herself.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:47.430
Our founding director, Adam,

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:51.190
was working on a plan to give 
form to the power of the gods.

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:57.040
We lost Tiki, the key to the plan,

00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:01.840
and were driven into the shadows of history.

00:13:03.870 --> 00:13:07.720
After 400 years, Finé was destroyed.

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:10.890
We brought down the US government

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:14.190
and, at last, had our chance 
to turn things around.

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:17.620
All we have to do now 
is take this doll home,

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:19.300
and we've accomplished our goal.

00:13:19.300 --> 00:13:22.020
That's not much fun, if you ask me.

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:25.820
Tiki is also an astronomical 
observation device.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:28.210
Recovering her is vital to 
the Illuminati's plans.

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:29.820
And more than anything...

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:34.340
We need her to create a proper 
history of man for this planet.

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:37.410
Right, Saint Germain?

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:40.380
No one should be ruled.

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:44.890
Then, I'll let you take care 
of bringing her back.

00:13:44.890 --> 00:13:48.600
I think I'll go say thank you 
for what they did to my cheek.

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:51.080
You want to confront the Symphogear Wielders

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:54.110
when the completion of Lapis is upon us?

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:56.330
How selfish.

00:13:56.330 --> 00:14:00.060
With the Youaltepuztli, it will be easy.

00:14:00.930 --> 00:14:04.090
I've lied so much already.

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:08.930
From now on, I want to
 at least remain true to my heart.

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:21.060
<i>Sonya Vilena.</i>

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:24.480
<i>Someone who supported my 
mom and dad in their desire</i>

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:26.460
<i>to bring peace to the world through song.</i>

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:31.510
<i>She was "Big Sis Sonya" to me, 
so kind when I was little.</i>

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:34.140
<i>But that day...</i>

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:37.000
<i>When that bomb was brought into the camp,</i>

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:39.400
<i>Mom and Dad died because she screwed up...</i>

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:47.450
<i>Just as you can't forgive me, 
I can't forgive you!</i>

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:51.550
It was my only choice!

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:55.620
I had to blow off his leg to save him 
from the Alca-Noise's dissolving attack!

00:14:56.010 --> 00:14:57.910
I didn't have a choice!

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:00.590
Maybe you did the right thing.

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:02.250
Still...

00:15:03.390 --> 00:15:05.420
<i>Why is it bothering me so much?</i>

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:09.600
<i>Why do the choices I make always...</i>

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:11.370
Chris-chan...

00:15:12.980 --> 00:15:18.900
I never got a chance to 
talk to you during the chaos.

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:22.520
I didn't want to reunite 
with you like this.

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:42.110
This is Tsubasa.

00:15:42.110 --> 00:15:45.460
Alca-Noise have been detected 
at Escalon Airport.

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:48.370
I'm sending Maria-kun's group there now.

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:52.460
They intend to finish the job 
while their LiNKER is still active.

00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:56.300
Roger. We'll drop the wounded 
off at a city hospital,

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:58.010
and go to help them.

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:05.800
Weren't these on our side?

00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:07.530
Do they look like—

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:16.940
So you start killing people 
until the Wielders show up.

00:16:16.940 --> 00:16:19.110
Oh, are you going to help?

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:21.840
I prioritize fun things.

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:25.010
That's why I had Saint Germain take Tiki home.

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:32.040
And there they are!

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:40.560
<i>Seilien coffin Airgetlám tron.</i>

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:15.280
<i>A voice echoes, where does it come from?</i>

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:18.480
<i>It's telling me to rise up</i>

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:18.470
<b>α Style 100 Samsara</b>

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:22.230
<i>My heart is pounding, when did it start?</i>

00:17:22.210 --> 00:17:24.640
Bringing out the big guns early, huh?

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:25.060
<i>Hold your courage up high</i>

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:26.040
I will, too!

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:28.990
<i>And set out now for tomorrow!</i>

00:17:28.050 --> 00:17:29.890
Got you!

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:32.300
Jeez, what are you doing?

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:40.380
Airgetlám, Shul Shagana, and Igalima 
have engaged the enemy!

00:17:40.380 --> 00:17:42.210
Compatibility coefficients are stable.

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:43.110
Guys...

00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:50.130
<i>I wanted to believe in them more than myself</i>

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:49.210
Now it's my turn. 
My invincible Youaltepuztli...

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:53.290
<i>It's hard to do it right</i>

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:56.670
Attack nullification... Ironclad defenses...

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:59.850
<i>Let's follow the one who taught us 
so much and cut away our weakness!</i>

00:17:56.670 --> 00:17:58.600
But you yourself aren't invincible!

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:03.970
<i>Drowning and struggling in 
the reason for our strength</i>

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.730
<i>We were swallowed by the darkness</i>

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:13.090
<i>Tiny bodies and immature hearts</i>

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:17.210
<i>I want to truly hear the 
words "Hang in there!"</i>

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:18.240
<i>If I can just keep hitting her so 
she can't summon that monster...</i>

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:18.860
<i>And answer them!</i>

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:22.380
<i>Turn our bonds into melodies</i>

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:27.860
<i>Making them a melody and
 blasting them into the sky!</i>

00:18:28.260 --> 00:18:31.340
<i>Even if I cry, I'll wipe my tears away</i>

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:30.630
Their compatibility coefficients 
are rapidly dropping.

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:32.870
Time is running out on their LiNKER.

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:36.380
<i>I'll keep going forward covered in wounds</i>

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:37.770
Commander, at the location Shul Shagana 
and Igalima are fighting, there's an...

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:41.240
<i>Even when I'm about to break, that 
"Hang in there" keeps me going</i>

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:40.140
An airplane?!

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:41.280
There's somebody there!

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:45.360
<i>I may be junk that can't fly high</i>

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:42.930
Some rather cute girls!

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:45.880
Ignore them! If we stop we're dead!

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:47.850
<i>But still I'll step forward</i>

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:54.510
<i>I'll never turn around, ever</i>

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:55.900
Shirabe!

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.400
I know exactly what you're 
thinking, Kiri-chan!

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:01.030
Go! Leave this to me!

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:03.410
Roger!

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:12.750
She thinks those two can do something.

00:19:14.890 --> 00:19:17.670
But can she do something about the two of us?

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:24.310
<i>It's up to me to decide my limits</i>

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:30.680
<i>It's up to me to decide if my end is here</i>

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:34.440
<i>Ask your heart</i>

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:38.150
<i>The sounds, the wind, the smiling flowers</i>

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:41.150
<i>They have something supporting them</i>

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:41.150
Hearts that never give up...

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:47.610
<i>They have a role they cannot play themselves</i>

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:46.720
That's...

00:19:47.610 --> 00:19:53.580
<i>Carrying the resolve to pass 
on that "Hang in there"</i>

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:52.550
Everyone, just hang in there another moment!

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:55.720
I'll make that moment last for eternity!

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:56.810
<i>You're never alone</i>

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:59.180
<i>I haven't given up on analyzing 
the LiNKER recipe!</i>

00:19:56.810 --> 00:20:02.210
<i>Awaken, sleeping power!</i>

00:19:59.180 --> 00:20:01.560
So... don't give up!

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:05.730
<i>If I keep passing it on forever</i>

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:08.920
<i>Will I be able to overcome my past?</i>

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:12.350
<i>Even the pain, even the suffering</i>

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:15.870
<i>With the magic words "Hang in there!"</i>

00:20:15.870 --> 00:20:19.730
<i>We can share them, play our 
songs together, save each other</i>

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:22.120
<i>Create our dreams together</i>

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:28.860
<i>Hold your feelings close to your heart!</i>

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:35.750
<i>Believing someday that you will be strong!</i>

00:20:45.630 --> 00:20:48.060
Well done, everyone.

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:11.970
They can still fight?

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:13.780
But we can't...

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:18.300
Come forth, my invincible Youaltepuztli!

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:29.770
No...

00:21:31.400 --> 00:21:33.870
This is all we can do when we're on a timer?

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:41.660
That won't work.

00:21:46.060 --> 00:21:48.200
But if she keeps punching anyway...

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:50.190
She'll punch a hole right 
through your rules!

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:57.620
What just happened?

00:21:57.620 --> 00:22:00.420
What happened to your invincibility?

00:22:02.300 --> 00:22:05.640
But I'm right here!
